# ─── Instagram Graph API (live follower count) ──────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to ".env.local" and fill in the two values below.
# See INSTAGRAM_SETUP.md for step-by-step instructions on getting them.
#
# Without these, the site falls back to the unofficial scraper, then to a
# static number — so the site never breaks if they're missing.

# Numeric ID of the Instagram Business/Creator account (NOT the @username).
IG_USER_ID=

# Long-lived (or system-user) Meta access token with instagram_basic scope.
IG_GRAPH_TOKEN=

# ─── Web3Forms (booking form) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Access key from https://web3forms.com — create one with the inbox email
# address that should receive booking requests. NEXT_PUBLIC_ because Web3Forms'
# free plan only accepts browser-originated submissions (their keys are public
# by design — like a form action URL); spam protection comes from the /api/book
# rate-limit gate + honeypots. Inlined at BUILD time — rebuild after changing.
# Until this is set, the form shows a graceful "email directly" message.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
